{"articleNo":"93117","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=93117&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[ACE사업] 2013년도 학생역량진단(K-CESA) 프로그램 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.10","hit":"3864","attachments":[{"name":"첨부1. 학생역량진단평가 신청안내 사항 및 신청서 1부..hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=93117&attachNo=73265"},{"name":"첨부2. 홍보 안내 자료 1부..pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=93117&attachNo=73267"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">대학교육역량강화사업단에서는 재학생을 대상으로 K-CESA(<strong>K</strong>orea <strong>C</strong>ollegiate <strong>E</strong>ssential <strong>S</strong>kills <strong>A</strong>ssessment : 대학생 핵심역량 평가) 프로그램의 응시자를 지원(무료)하고자 하오니 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 신청바랍니다. </span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">K-CESA란? </span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 445.01pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 75.25pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 대학생들의 핵심역량 수준을 판단하여 학생들의 진로개발을 지원 및 취업능력 제고를 위한 자기계발 가이드를 제공하기 위하여 교육과학기술부와 한국직업능력개발원의 주도하에 한국교육평가학회와 다수의 전문가의 지원을 받아 개발된 진단도구입니다.</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">※ 공과대학 학부교육에 적합한 4개 영역 평가 </span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: ①의사소통역량, ②자원정보기술활용역량, ③글로벌역량, ④자기관리역량</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▣ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>신청 연장 기간 : </strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2013.&nbsp;10.25(금)</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">까지</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▣ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>신청방법 : </strong>첨부된 신청서를 작성하여 각 학부(과) 행정실로 제출</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▣ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>신청자격 :</strong> 학부(과)별 희망자를 대상으로 선정(계획인원 : 총 1,000명) </span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">☞ 학생들의 역량 향상정도를 비교, 평가할 수 있도록 가능한 2012년도에 응시한 학생들도 많이 참여하여 주시기 바랍니다.(혜택 : 아래 인센티브 참조)</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 